{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122996","id":4395055177,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBfc4SQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122996","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122996.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122996.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122996","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122996/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122996/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122996/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6e0cc0961d40d677204a282ced0e46735ceb2e84","number":122996,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Jolt: Use `PositionAndVelocity` motor state when motor and spring are both enabled","user":{"login":"robinlacey","id":681551,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTU1MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/681551?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robinlacey","html_url":"https://github.com/robinlacey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robinlacey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robinlacey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robinlacey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robinlacey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robinlacey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robinlacey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robinlacey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robinlacey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robinlacey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"### What\r\nImplemnts the fix discussed in godotengine/godot-proposals#14845.\r\n\r\nJolt's `SixDOFConstraint` supports `EMotorState::PositionAndVelocity`:\r\n\r\n```\r\nforce = stiffness * (target_position - current_position)\r\n      + damping   * (target_velocity - current_velocity)\r\n```\r\n\r\n`_update_motor_state()` never selects it, because the state was added in Jolt 5.6.0 and the mapping predates that integration (#121260). Enabling both the motor and the spring flags on an axis therefore selects `Velocity`, and the spring settings are silently unused.\r\n\r\n| `motor_enabled` | `spring_enabled` | before | after |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| yes | yes | `Velocity` (spring settings unused) | `PositionAndVelocity` |\r\n| yes | no  | `Velocity` | `Velocity` |\r\n| no  | yes | `Position` | `Position` |\r\n| no  | no  | `Off` | `Off` |\r\n\r\nOnly the first row changes, so no existing configuration behaves differently unless it was already setting both flags and losing the spring.\r\n\r\n### Why \r\n\r\n`Position` damps against absolute velocity, so the damping term resists all motion including the motion needed to follow a moving target. `PositionAndVelocity` damps against velocity error instead, which is what a servo tracking an animated pose needs.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n\r\nI couldn't find a place to add a test for this. So I built against 4.8-dev2  and manually testsed. A 6DOF joint with all three angular axes driven, stiffness 400, damping 40, 50° target:\r\n\r\n| target velocity | both flags | motor only | spring only |\r\n|---|---|---|---|\r\n| 0 rad/s | 50° → 0.0° | 50° → 50° (no movement) | 50° → 0.0° |\r\n| 2 rad/s | 50° → 23.3°, settles | 50° → 136.8°, still rotating | 50° → 0.0° |\r\n\r\nThe residual at a non-zero velocity target is the expected steady state, approximately `damping * target_velocity / stiffness`.\r\n\r\n### AI Disclaimer\r\nI used a 🤖 to \r\n- understand the Godot/Jolt codebase to find this bit of the code (to get my active ragdolls working)\r\n- wrangle git for this PR \r\n\r\n@jrouwe verified understanding/fix on godotengine/godot-proposals#14845 and suggested I create PR. ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471880,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE4ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:physics","name":"topic:physics","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https:/